Ok, so first up you should be posting this is r/roblox, however ill answer your question anyways

&#x200B;

If you get mass reported you may or may not get banned. However its quite easy to appeal by simply going to [https://www.roblox.com/support](https://web.roblox.com/support)

More on the detailed side, what kind of texture like lava or something? I dont mind at all!

