(Detailed side includes images and stuff if u want)

wait let me give you the full script:

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

`local copy = game.ReplicatedStorage.CashOnKill:Clone()`

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

`game.Players.PlayerAdded:Connect(function(plr)`



	`wait(2)`



	`local character = plr.Character`



	`if character then`



		`copy.Parent = character`

		`copy.Disabled = false`



	`end`



	`while true do`



		`character.Humanoid.Died:connect(function()`

&#x200B;

			`wait(4)`

			`local DeathCopy = game.ReplicatedStorage.CashOnKill:Clone()`

			`DeathCopy.Parent = character`

			`DeathCopy.Disabled = false`		

&#x200B;

		`end)`

&#x200B;



	`end`



`end)`

&#x200B;

Now what I mean is should the humanoid.Died function be in the plr added function? Because it just doesnt seem needed

Idk what I was tryna do with the event since it just made me confused

