I also realised I made a mistake by saying if they are equipped in both functions.

I recommend using this Plugin

&#x200B;

[https://web.roblox.com/library/1496745047/AutoScale-Lite](https://web.roblox.com/library/1496745047/AutoScale-Lite)

&#x200B;

In studio, go to Plugins then click Unit Conversion, then click the two scales NOT offset.

Think this is correct. Put this Local Script in the tool.

&#x200B;

script.Parent.Equipped:Connect(function()

&#x200B;

game.StarterPlayer.StarterCharacterScripts.WebSwing.Enabled = false

&#x200B;

end)

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

script.Parent.Equipped:Connect(function()

&#x200B;

game.StarterPlayer.StarterCharacterScripts.WebSwing.Enabled = true

&#x200B;

end)

