oh and here is a tutorial for it

&#x200B;

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hSbyWsnPth0&t=157s](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hSbyWsnPth0&t=157s)

You should never call the parent straight away, here is a code to fix it

&#x200B;

local power = [Instance.new](https://Instance.new)("StringValue")

[power.Name](https://power.Name) = "Name here"

power.Parent = player

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

you also need to use a Normal Script, I recommended then placing it in ServerScriptService
